config d_model=416 n_layers=5 n_heads=18 d_head=36 d_mlp=160 pos=learned bias=true tie=true
# Residual layout: 0-5 class(num,file,key,val,tmpl,spec) 6-15 digitA 16-25 digitB 26-35 digitC (token code = class+A+B+C, tied unembed => logit = code overlap)
# 36 P(pos) 37 Q(pos^2) 38-75 token flags 80-94 prev/turn flags 102-125 user-turn facts 130-139 pointers 140-153 tool/result state
# 160-171 key code copy 190-204 intents 220-229 pointer selectors 260 final pointer 261-262 content gate 300-371 template-token ids

group code.tmpl | mechanism: template words get code (class4, A=n//10, B=n%10, C=0) plus a one-hot id channel 300+n | why: tied unembed makes output logit = overlap with code, so writing 16 on the 4 code dims emits that word; id channel lets neurons test the current token
embed @hello 300,4,6,16,26 = 1
embed @! 301,4,6,17,26 = 1
embed @i 302,4,6,18,26 = 1
embed @can 303,4,6,19,26 = 1
