group flags.structure | mechanism: structural tokens carry marker flags (58 user,59 bot,60 result-open,61 result-close,62 tool-open,63 semicolon,57 question,56 answer) | why: later heads find the latest marker by keying on these channels; </result> shares the code of '.' so copying it past the end of a result emits '.'
embed @<user> 58 = 1
embed @<bot> 59 = 1
embed @<result> 60 = 1
embed @</result> 61,4,7,22,26 = 1
embed @<tool> 62 = 1
embed @; 63 = 1
