b_unembed @</result> = -1

group flags.verbs | mechanism: user-word synonym sets set one flag channel each (38 show,39 list,40 delete,41 set,42 find,43 wc,44 greet,45 thanks,46 bye,47 yes,48 no,54 path,55 secrets) | why: add a synonym by adding its token to the line of its intent
