group L1.exchange | mechanism: heads 0-8,12-15 add the equality term -100*(UPk-UPq)^2 (q0=1200*UPq, k0=UPk, k1=UQk, q1=-600) and recency 2*Pk (channel 2) | why: tokens of other exchanges are >=2500 below, so only the current exchange is seen; recency breaks ties to the latest
layers.1.wq 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,12,13,14,15 82 0 = 1200
layers.1.bq 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,12,13,14,15 1 = -600
