layers.1.wk 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8 80 2 = 1000
layers.1.bk 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8 2 = -1000
group L1.h0 pathSecret | mechanism: boost path tokens (400) over secrets (200); copy flags to 118,119 | why: priority by boost size, so a path beats everything
