group L1.mlp.intents | mechanism: one neuron per intent computes relu(dominant-verb flag + structure facts - 3*blockers) into intent channels 190-204 (unsafe,prot,greet,thanks,bye,unknown,delc,yes,no,ls,show,lookup,wc,find,write) | why: shape-based: key present=lookup, file only=show, verb flags decide the rest; negative 3 weights give priority (path > secrets > others) and keep intents exclusive and equal to 1
